@startuml
title Weather Station System States

[*] --> Running : Shutdown
state "Running" as Running
state "Configuration" as Configuration
state "Collecting Data" as CollectingData
state "Preparing Summary" as PreparingSummary
state "Checking Status" as CheckingStatus
state "Controlled Mode" as ControlledMode
state "Shutdown" as Shutdown

Running --> Configuration : Changes or Power-saving Settings
Running --> CollectingData : Clock Triggered
Running --> PreparingSummary : Summary Request
Running --> CheckingStatus : Status Request
Running --> ControlledMode : Remote Control
Running --> Shutdown : Shutdown Command

Configuration --> Running : Configuration Completed
CollectingData --> Running : Activity Completed
PreparingSummary --> Running : Activity Completed
CheckingStatus --> Running : Activity Completed
ControlledMode --> Running : Normal Operation
Shutdown --> Shutdown : Successful Shutdown

title Alert Notifier Component States

[*] --> InitializeComponent : Load Component
state "Initialize\nComponent" as InitializeComponent
state "Waiting for Update" as WaitingForUpdate
state "Processing Update" as ProcessingUpdate
state "Unloading" as Unloading

InitializeComponent --> WaitingForUpdate : Successful Initialization
WaitingForUpdate --> WaitingForUpdate : No Updates Detected
WaitingForUpdate --> ProcessingUpdate : Update Detected
ProcessingUpdate --> WaitingForUpdate : Update Processed
Unloading --> [*] : System Shutdown or Failure

title Equihealth States

[*] --> J1 : [check user]
state J1 <<choice>>
state J2 : PatientDashboard
state J3 : HealthWorkerDashboard
state J4 : GovernmentOfficialDashboard
state J5 : Logout

J1 --> J2 : Patient
J1 --> J3 : Health Worker
J1 --> J4 : Government Official
J2 --> J5 : Task Completed
J3 --> J5 : Task Completed
J4 --> J5 : Task Completed

title National Health Id States

[*] --> Choice1 : Check Citizenship
state Choice1 <<choice>>
state Choice2 : Verify Details
state Choice3 : Generate ID
state Choice4 : Activate Account
state Choice5 : Set Permissions
state Choice6 : Add Old Files
state Choice7 : Store Files
state Choice8 : Provide Access
state Choice9 : Add New Files
state Choice10 : Government Access

Choice1 --> Choice2 : Indian
Choice1 --> [*] : Not Indian
Choice2 --> Choice3 : Verified
Choice3 --> Choice4 : Account Activated
Choice4 --> Choice5 : After Activation
Choice5 --> Choice6 : Add Old Files
Choice6 --> Choice7 : Stored Files
Choice7 --> Choice8 : Provide Access
Choice8 --> [*] : Task Completed
Choice5 --> Choice9 : Set Permissions
Choice9 --> [*] : Permission Granted
Choice9 --> Choice10 : Government Access
@enduml
